      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Explanatory text about the requirement defined or determined by a competent authority in order to ensure public passenger transport services in the general interest that an operator, if it were considering its own commercial interests, would not assume or would not assume to the same extent or under the same conditions without reward. (epo:ContractTerm)"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#historyNote": [
