      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The amount of tenders received from micro, small and medium-sized enterprises. <u>Additional Information:</u> See Commission Recommendation 2003/361/EC. The ReceivedSMETenderLots is used when the size of the company is not exactly known. (epo:SubmissionStatisticalInformation)"
      }
    ],
